  "details": "It would be nice to have some sort of Collision check group in the receivers like\nOn group 1 i'd have some custom Senders and that would output 1 as an int\nOn group 2 I could have hands our fingers and it would output 2 as an int\non group 3 I could have feets and it would output 3 as an int\nI don't know how possible that could be, but i think i could help make more system with less receivers.\nRight now I'm making a dynamic Avatar Combat system and to get some Special damage like elemental it could help a lot without having to make a special receiver that hosts that specific damage so it can trigger a specific thing in my animator",
